==Description==
The '''Pirate Crate''' is a crate purchasable for {{Coins|3,500}}. You can also buy the Unwavering Tides Bundle [[Gamepasses|gamepass]], which will give you skins that you can claim through the [[Gift Box]]. This crate yields 16 pirate-themed skins. Skins from this crate can appear [[Daily Store#Daily Skin Store|Daily Skin Store]].

Each skin that can be obtained from the '''Pirate Crate''' has a rarity which affects how likely you are to unlock the skin and the price when it appears in the Daily Skin Store. In the Daily Skin Store, {{Color|Common}} skins cost {{Coins|3,500}}, {{Color|Uncommon}} skins cost {{Coins|4,000}}, {{Color|Rare}} skins cost {{Coins|5,000}} and {{Color|Legendary}} skins cost {{Coins|7,000}}.

While this crate does come with a bundle, it does not give every skin. The skins given are {{Color|Pirate}} [[Mortar]], {{Color|Pirate}} [[Gladiator]], {{Color|Pirate}} [[Crook Boss]], {{Color|Pirate}} [[Mortar]], {{Color|Pirate}} [[Farm]], {{Color|Pirate}} [[Hunter]] and {{Color|Pirate}} [[Warden]].

==Appearance==
The '''Pirate Crate''' is a wooden chest with ship wheels on it. On the front of the chest, there is a hole in the shape of an "x". There is also a lot of gold and diamonds inside the chest. The chest is opened using a key.

