==Trivia==
*Multiple {{Color|Pirate|Pirate}} skins from this crate were based on a [https://discord.com/channels/587355301083349002/615753550626291717/856189657108316171 Unwavering Tides skin submission] from the Tower Defense Simulator Discord. The original skins can be found [https://imgur.com/a/B9cj4yC here].
*The '''Pirate Crate''' has the most skins for event [[Towers]] out of any crate.

